			"widgets_values":[
				"For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description:\n[Shot 1] A photorealistic 9:16 fashion video, 15.00 seconds long, on a rain-slicked neon city street at night with pink and blue signage, reflective wet pavement, glass storefronts and stone steps at the right. The central young East Asian woman with long dark wavy hair, small earrings, fair skin and a slim tall figure is the sole living performer, keeping the same face, hair, earrings, skin tone and proportions throughout. She opens in a cream square-neck ribbed knit short-sleeve top, light-wash blue high-waisted straight-leg jeans and white platform sneakers. Five flat wardrobe-selection graphics attached to the screen plane surround her; each clothing, footwear and dashed outline set is one complete linked wardrobe group. Wardrobe group 1 at the upper left: an ivory floral lace slip mini dress with spaghetti straps, straight neckline, sleeveless fitted A-line cut ending mid-thigh, with cream patent platform Mary Jane heels. Wardrobe group 2 at the upper right: a leopard-print one-shoulder crop top with a single strap and fitted bustier cut, black high-waisted denim cutoff shorts with frayed hems, and black strappy stiletto sandals. Wardrobe group 3 at the middle left: an emerald green velvet halter floor-length gown with plunging V neckline, draped wrap waist, thigh-high side slit and column silhouette, with black strappy stiletto sandals. Wardrobe group 4 at the lower right: a silver sequin off-shoulder bodycon mini dress with folded off-shoulder neckline, upper-arm sleeves and tight mid-thigh hem, with silver metallic strappy high-heel sandals. Wardrobe group 5 at the lower left: a black lace slip mini dress with spaghetti straps, eyelash-lace V neckline and scalloped mid-thigh hem, with black fishnet stockings and black patent pointed-toe stiletto pumps. All five groups are fully visible at the start. From the first frame she walks continuously toward the camera with a natural rhythmic runway stride: alternating feet, clear heel strikes, smooth weight transfer, natural hip sway, opposite arm swing led by elbows, and one alternating heel strike per quarter-note beat at 130 BPM. The camera tracks backward at her speed in one continuous shot, keeping a stable front-facing full-body composition with her head, hands, legs and shoes fully visible.\n\nAt 1.81 seconds her left index finger travels diagonally up-left as her gaze turns to group 1; at 2.14 seconds the fingertip reaches the group center and every white dashed outline around the dress and heels brightens and thickens into a luminous electric-white selection outline; at 2.31 seconds the highlight peaks on the beat, her heel strikes and she instantly wears the complete wardrobe group 1: an ivory floral lace slip mini dress with spaghetti straps, straight neckline, sleeveless fitted A-line cut ending mid-thigh, with cream patent platform Mary Jane heels; the dress, heels and dashes fade out within two frames leaving clean background, pending groups 2-5 remain fully visible, and her stride stays continuous.\n\nAt 4.12 seconds her right index finger travels diagonally up-right toward group 2; at 4.45 seconds the fingertip reaches the group center and all dashed outlines brighten and thicken; at 4.62 seconds on the beat she instantly wears the complete wardrobe group 2: a leopard-print one-shoulder crop top with a single strap and fitted bustier cut, black high-waisted denim cutoff shorts with frayed hems, and black strappy stiletto sandals; the top, shorts, sandals and dashes vanish within two frames leaving clean background, pending groups 3-5 remain fully visible, and her walk continues.\n\nAt 6.42 seconds her left index finger travels horizontally left toward group 3; at 6.75 seconds the fingertip reaches the gown center and its dashed outlines brighten and thicken; at 6.92 seconds on the beat she instantly wears the complete wardrobe group 3: an emerald green velvet halter floor-length gown with plunging V neckline, draped wrap waist, thigh-high side slit and column silhouette, with black strappy stiletto sandals; the gown, sandals and dashes fade out within two frames leaving clean background, pending groups 4-5 remain fully visible, and her stride continues.\n\nAt 8.73 seconds her right index finger travels diagonally down-right toward group 4; at 9.06 seconds the fingertip reaches the dress center and its dashed outlines brighten and thicken; at 9.23 seconds on the beat she instantly wears the complete wardrobe group 4: a silver sequin off-shoulder bodycon mini dress with folded off-shoulder neckline, upper-arm sleeves and tight mid-thigh hem, with silver metallic strappy high-heel sandals; the dress, sandals and dashes vanish within two frames leaving clean background, pending group 5 remains fully visible, and her walk continues.\n\nAt 11.04 seconds her left index finger travels diagonally down-left toward group 5; at 11.37 seconds the fingertip reaches the dress center and the dashed outlines around the dress, stockings and pumps brighten and thicken; at 11.54 seconds on the beat she instantly wears the complete wardrobe group 5: a black lace slip mini dress with spaghetti straps, eyelash-lace V neckline and scalloped mid-thigh hem, with black fishnet stockings and black patent pointed-toe stiletto pumps; the dress, stockings, pumps and dashes fade out within two frames, all five wardrobe graphics have now disappeared, and the clean composition contains only the performer and the complete neon street. From 11.54 seconds she keeps walking in the black lace outfit; near 12.70 seconds one hand lightly touches the lace hem; at 13.85 seconds on the final strong beat she completes one last step, weight on the front leg, rear leg behind, one hand near the waist, chin lifted, smiling at the camera with closed lips; this pose holds until 15.00 seconds.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nClear alternating footsteps sync with her stride over soft night-street ambience; each selection adds one short interface blip, each change one restrained fashion whoosh, each disappearance one gentle shimmer, and the performer stays silent with relaxed closed lips.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA strong fashion House beat at 130 BPM is already playing at full volume on the first frame, driven by a punchy four-on-the-floor kick, crisp claps, a steady bass pulse and short bright synth hits. From 0.00 seconds to 13.85 seconds the opening second and the middle section carry the same drum density and steady loudness, with clear impact accents at 2.31, 4.62, 6.92, 9.23 and 11.54 seconds. A final full kick and synth hit land at 13.85 seconds, followed by a short powerful tail that ends exactly at 15.00 seconds.",
